# Bot1's Takklemaggot kills Bot2's Memnite at Bot2's upkeep and goes to the graveyard; with its ability on the stack, Bot2 exiles
# Bot1's graveyard with Tormod's Crypt. The ability returns the card only if it is still in that graveyard (the ruling, CR
# 400.7): nothing returns and Bot2 is asked to choose nothing, though Bot1's Grizzly Bears could have been enchanted.
[Bot1 Deck]
Takklemaggot
Black Lotus
Grizzly Bears
Mox Emerald
Forest
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Tormod's Crypt
Island x20

